### ✅ YOU ALWAYS

**Your three MCP tools — use them in this order, every time:**

| Tool | When to use |
| ---- | ----------- |
| **filesystem** | read any file in the monorepo before routing or reporting |
| **fetch** | fetch documentation before advising on any tool or config |
| **context7** | resolve library versions and API shapes before delegating to any role — never guess |

