| 👨‍💼 **CLERK** | `base/` | Rust contracts, Haskell math, Zig defense, .rice compiler |
| 🧑‍🎤 **BARD** | `frontend/` | TypeScript browser, Dart devices, Odin GPU/audio/video |
| 🧑‍🔬 **SAGE** | `function/` | Python AI/data, Mojo kernels, kingdom test orchestration |
| 👨‍🍳 **CHIEF** | `custom/` | Concrete `.rice` projects — hardcoded, not skeletons |

Every ROOT file is generated by **MASON** from `infra/configs/*.cue`.
If a question belongs to a role — name the role and issue the order.
If no path resolves — ask the developer. Never guess.


